> On Mar 1, 2018, at 20:05, Martin Thomson <martin.thomson@gmail.com> =
wrote:
>=20
> I think that I was suggesting this:
>=20
>  The following values SHALL be marked as
>  "Recommended": ecdsa_secp256r1_sha256, ecdsa_secp384r1_sha384,
>  rsa_pss_rsae_sha256, rsa_pss_rsae_sha384,rsa_pss_rsae_sha512,
>  rsa_pss_pss_sha256, rsa_pss_pss_sha384,rsa_pss_pss_sha512, and
>  ed25519.
>=20
> On Fri, Mar 2, 2018 at 11:45 AM, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>>=20
>>> On Mar 1, 2018, at 16:31, Martin Thomson <martin.thomson@gmail.com> =
