>>>> people to be using, thus it should be Recommended, but pss_rsae is =
what
>>>> people are actually going to be using (to large extent), and that =
is
>>>> still a deployment that we consider good and useful, for now.  =
Maybe in
>>>> 5 years the IESG can change those "yes"es to "no"s, of course.
>>>=20
>>> I think that I agree.  For recommendations PSS is fine.  If the
>>> question is MTI, then I think we're stuck with pss_rsae.
>>=20
