>>=20
>> NEW:
>>=20
>>  The following values SHALL be marked as
>>  "Recommended": ecdsa_secp256r1_sha256, ecdsa_secp384r1_sha384,
>>  rsa_pss_rsae_sha256, rsa_pss_rsae_sha384,rsa_pss_rsae_sha512, and
>>  ed25519.
